    "overrideRationale": "The out-of-box tables are administrative analytics and transcript stores. The Agents SDK cannot list conversations or retrieve prior activities from them for Web Chat, and their retention and access controls are environment-admin concerns. User-owned sidecar tables are required for secure recent-conversation discovery, server-side conversation resumption, and deterministic activity replay.",
